INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-acceptable-use','acceptable-use','Acceptable Use','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'acceptable-use-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Acceptable Use

Use Lex for lawful enquiries and authorized professional work. Do not impersonate clients, guardians, organizations or lawyers; fabricate credentials; alter evidence deceptively; submit malware; harass or threaten others; exploit a child; infringe rights; or attempt unauthorized access, payment bypass or security interference. Do not place unrelated credentials, card secrets or excessive third-party information in a matter.

Good-faith reporting, criticism, complaints and lawful evidence submission are not prohibited merely because they concern wrongdoing. Material that is relevant to a legal issue may be distressing or disputed; explain its context and avoid unnecessary copies. Reporting an allegation does not establish its truth.

Lex may investigate misuse, preserve relevant evidence and restrict the affected operation or account proportionately. Where lawful and safe, we explain the reason and provide a review route. Immediate action may be necessary to protect a person, secure accounts or comply with law. We do not automatically suspend unrelated services because one upload or feature fails.

Report abuse through [COMPLAINTS_CONTACT] and urgent safeguarding concerns through [SAFEGUARDING_CONTACT]. Do not use this reporting channel as an emergency response service. Professional misconduct concerns may also be directed to the appropriate professional body. Enforcement must respect confidentiality, lawful retention and the rights of affected parties.
',1,'E9saCVwW9RXCJu0W+xA7Gzio28Ch6tpjDt1Bc4vUz8I=','["COMPLAINTS_CONTACT","SAFEGUARDING_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='acceptable-use';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-accessibility','accessibility','Accessibility Statement','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'accessibility-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Accessibility Statement

Lex aims to make legal access usable with assistive technologies, keyboard navigation, readable contrast and adjustable text. Intake should retain answers when a section is reopened, show errors near the affected field and provide a supported alternative to optional voice or camera input. Transcripts and correction controls assist users who cannot rely on audio.

Report a barrier through [ACCESSIBILITY_CONTACT], describing the screen, device or assistive technology and the task you were attempting. Do not include unnecessary legal facts in the accessibility report. We will work with you on an alternative route and assess a correction. We do not claim a formal WCAG conformance level or certification without a supporting audit.

Language support does not guarantee that automated translation is correct. Important legal and consent text requires suitable review, and users may ask for clarification before acceptance. Emergency or safeguarding matters should not depend solely on an inaccessible control; available human support should explain another safe route without promising emergency service.
',1,'K9J+uBiPQQkjue7cOqmzNQjb6cZbG0p5EJT1XxDf4lY=','["ACCESSIBILITY_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='accessibility';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-ai-routing-disclosure','ai-routing-disclosure','AI Assistance and Automated Routing','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'ai-routing-disclosure-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# AI Assistance and Automated Routing

Lex can use AI to organize an enquiry, suggest practice areas and missing questions, transcribe voice, translate intake confirmations, summarize facts and assist lawyer drafting. It does not replace a lawyer, provide an independently approved legal opinion, predict outcomes, calculate court deadlines or choose the final lawyer for you.

Before sending matter information to an AI provider, Lex explains the purpose and requests the applicable permission. You can decline optional AI and use available structured intake. Do not include passwords, verification codes, payment secrets or irrelevant personal records. Only information needed for the stated task should be transmitted. Relevant providers and international processing are described in the Subprocessors and Privacy Notices.

AI can misunderstand accents, language, chronology, names and legal categories. Inspect and correct the transcript, proposed classification and English record before confirming them. Confirmation means the record reflects what you told us; it does not mean a lawyer has approved a conclusion. English is the authoritative professional record, with supported-language explanations for client confirmation.

Urgency, conflicting facts, safeguarding concerns and uncertain output require human review. Ask for a human or challenge routing through the matter controls. A challenge must not be treated as acceptance of the contested result. AI cannot mark an assessment lawyer-reviewed; only the responsible lawyer can attest and deliver it.

You can withdraw permission for future optional AI processing. This does not automatically erase records already lawfully created or obligations under an existing engagement; privacy requests are assessed separately. Questions: [PRIVACY_CONTACT].
',1,'lY3rynoNlTNgkdWI5lUUsLO+QA/Y3K85QPQwPWde/uE=','["PRIVACY_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='ai-routing-disclosure';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-complaints-disputes','complaints-disputes','Complaints and Dispute Resolution','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'complaints-disputes-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Complaints and Dispute Resolution

Submit a complaint through the account support controls or [COMPLAINTS_CONTACT]. Include a matter or payment reference, the issue, relevant dates and the outcome you seek. Do not send verification codes or unnecessary sensitive documents in ordinary email. Assistance must remain available for accessibility barriers and account-access problems.

We record receipt, classify the concern, identify the responsible team and explain next steps. Safety and account-compromise concerns receive priority assessment. The reviewer should not be the person whose conduct is being challenged where an independent reviewer is available. We may request proportionate evidence and give the other affected party an opportunity to respond where lawful and safe.

The outcome should explain findings, any correction, refund, reassignment or other remedy, and how to request further review. A provider settlement delay is tracked separately from a complaint decision. The reviewed operational schedule will publish acknowledgement and response targets: [COMPLAINT_RESPONSE_SCHEDULE]. We will explain material delays rather than imply that a request has been resolved.

Platform complaints, payment disputes and professional-conduct concerns may have different responsible bodies. You retain the right to contact your bank, relevant consumer or privacy regulator, professional body or court. No mandatory arbitration waiver is imposed by this draft. Informal resolution is voluntary and does not remove non-waivable rights or extend legal deadlines.
',1,'60au0d1Ws7C//k1tI6m5coWQrdHWG7yWRBirK4ay1pE=','["COMPLAINTS_CONTACT","COMPLAINT_RESPONSE_SCHEDULE"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='complaints-disputes';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-consultation-assessment','consultation-assessment','Consultation and Assessment Terms','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'consultation-assessment-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Consultation and Assessment Terms

The service comprises the scope shown before payment: scheduled secure text consultation, relevant asynchronous messages or voice notes, review of submitted material and a lawyer-written assessment. It does not include native voice/video calling, representation, negotiation, filing or court attendance unless separately agreed. The identified lawyer provides the professional service; Golden Epic Limited coordinates platform access.

The service record must show the fee, currency, lawyer, timing, required information and exclusions. The default test setting of NGN 10,000 and 48 hours is not an approved public tariff. The delivery timer begins only after verified payment and complete required information. A lawyer''s request for missing information must explain what is needed and record any justified pause; time may not be paused secretly.

Attend the agreed consultation or use the rescheduling route promptly. Provide truthful facts and identify uncertainties. Correct transcripts and summaries before relying on them. The lawyer may explain that a question needs a different specialist, further evidence or a separately scoped engagement. The assessment should state the reviewed materials, assumptions, limitations and recommended next steps. No particular result is promised.

If the lawyer cannot provide the purchased service, you may choose eligible reassignment or the applicable refund. Duplicate charges and non-delivery are handled under the Payments Policy. A missed appointment or cancellation is assessed against the disclosed service terms and work actually performed; no undisclosed automatic forfeiture applies. Contact [SUPPORT_CONTACT] for scheduling and [COMPLAINTS_CONTACT] for unresolved service concerns.
',1,'QbEN/oCTd9s4u+Dxs8Sfg65/clhJ2r35i84ITIk4AbE=','["SUPPORT_CONTACT","COMPLAINTS_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='consultation-assessment';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-cookie-notice','cookie-notice','Cookie Notice and Preferences','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'cookie-notice-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Cookie Notice and Preferences

Lex uses essential browser storage for authenticated sessions, security and your consent choices. Essential storage is used only for those purposes. The mobile application also uses secure device storage for credentials and draft recovery; browser cookie preferences do not remove a mobile account.

Optional analytics, personalization and marketing storage must remain off until you choose the relevant purpose. Rejecting optional storage does not prevent access to legal services. You can change or withdraw your choice through Cookie Preferences; withdrawal stops future optional processing and initiates removal of the optional identifiers controlled by Lex. Providers may retain prior records where their disclosed terms and applicable law permit.

The deployment must maintain a technology register naming each cookie or local-storage item, its owner, purpose, duration and recipients. No optional technology may be activated solely because this notice lists a category. The initial release uses no advertising trackers. Essential account tokens expire or are revoked through account/session controls; clearing browser storage signs you out but does not delete server records.

Contact [PRIVACY_CONTACT] about storage or privacy. A new purpose requires an updated notice and an appropriate choice before activation. This notice works with the Privacy Notice and does not constitute consent to unrelated provider tracking.
',1,'qhJEtLBKL0zPIKK4duKdYkX/r3HBjhUpzr5vOC7sUHA=','["PRIVACY_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='cookie-notice';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-copyright-ip','copyright-ip','Copyright and Intellectual Property','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'copyright-ip-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Copyright and Intellectual Property

Lex software, branding and authored platform materials are protected by the rights of their respective owners or licensors. Golden Epic Limited operates the Nigerian service; GoldenEpic Solutions Inc. provides technology under documented permissions. Neither this notice nor common ownership assigns intellectual property between companies or founders.

You retain your rights in information and materials you submit. You grant only the permissions reasonably required to store, secure, transmit and process them for the requested service and disclosed lawful purposes. You must have a lawful basis to submit another person''s material. This permission is not a licence to sell your matter information, advertise with it or publish it publicly.

The lawyer''s engagement specifies the client''s permitted use of commissioned work and any retained professional rights. Public statutes and judgments are not claimed as proprietary Lex material. Third-party libraries, templates and sources retain their applicable licences and attribution requirements.

To report alleged infringement, contact [IP_CONTACT] with the material, your rights, the basis of the claim and a reachable reply address. We may request clarification and preserve an appropriate record. A disputed allegation alone does not establish ownership. Trademark availability and assignments require separate review; the generated Lex icon is not represented as a registered trademark.
',1,'8qxU73HAciMr0Xu++xy0iCOlB7hK2PlYYIX+ZzJzkGU=','["IP_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='copyright-ip';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-data-rights-retention','data-rights-retention','Data Rights, Retention and Deletion','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'data-rights-retention-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Data Rights, Retention and Deletion

Golden Epic Limited reviews access, correction, export, deletion, restriction and consent-withdrawal requests through account privacy controls and [PRIVACY_CONTACT]. We use proportionate identity checks, request clarification when needed and explain the result or lawful reason for refusal. Do not submit passwords or OTPs as identity evidence.

Account deletion is separate from uninstalling the app or cancelling a legal engagement. Where records must be retained for a specific legal obligation, claim, professional duty or active dispute, we identify the retained category and reason, restrict use and review the hold. A deletion request must not silently destroy another party''s records or a lawyer''s legally required file.

The retention schedule must specify purpose, lawful basis, trigger, period and deletion method for accounts, OTPs, sessions, authority evidence, credentials, matters, voice, transcripts, payments, AI records, audit and legal acceptances. [APPROVED_RETENTION_SCHEDULE] remains required before publication; this draft does not assert that unimplemented deletion jobs already operate. Provider retention and encrypted-backup expiry must be covered as well as the active database.

Corrections preserve provenance where necessary rather than rewriting an audit trail. Withdrawn optional consent stops future optional processing and creates a history event. On approved deletion, remove or irreversibly anonymize eligible data, record a minimal deletion marker and prevent restored backups from resurrecting deleted accounts. Exports must be identity-checked, scoped and delivered through expiring authenticated access. Rights under applicable data-protection law remain available regardless of these internal procedures.
',1,'8QfhlznaZHx8n4aU9EpplKumpIHcHpwXxRkqZizv06A=','["PRIVACY_CONTACT","APPROVED_RETENTION_SCHEDULE"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='data-rights-retention';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-electronic-communications','electronic-communications','Electronic Communications','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'electronic-communications-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Electronic Communications

Lex offers transactional communication by supported in-app messages, WhatsApp, email and device notifications. Choose the channels you can access securely. Security and service notices are distinguished from optional marketing; accepting a legal engagement does not subscribe you to advertising.

WhatsApp and email involve external delivery providers and may display previews on shared devices. Prefer assessment-ready links over sending sensitive advice in notification bodies. Verify the destination before linking a channel. Never share OTPs or approve a sign-in you did not initiate. Delivery or read status does not prove that you understood or accepted a contract.

You can change preferences, withdraw optional permissions and use STOP for supported WhatsApp opt-out. A security, payment or legal notice may still need another available lawful channel; the consequences of losing access will be explained. Push permission is requested in context and can be changed through device settings. Denying push does not cancel your account.

Electronic legal approval requires an identified version and an express authenticated action. Neither opening a link nor receiving an email counts as a signature. Keep copies of documents and receipts. Tell [SUPPORT_CONTACT] when a destination is compromised or no longer yours. The Privacy Notice explains processing and retention of delivery records.
',1,'TIJl0QLZxp+67/HcKzlCYmnX1xcVdoV9SkuSvOvW8Yw=','["SUPPORT_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='electronic-communications';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-emergency-outcomes','emergency-outcomes','Emergencies and Outcomes','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'emergency-outcomes-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Emergencies and Outcomes

Lex is not an emergency service. It cannot promise immediate lawyer availability, police intervention, protection, medical response, bail, an injunction or any court result. If there is immediate danger, seek appropriate local emergency assistance or a trusted safe support channel. Do not wait for an AI reply or scheduled consultation when delay may endanger someone.

Urgency flags send relevant requests to restricted human review. They do not guarantee a response time, establish representation or suspend legal deadlines. Avoid disclosing an unsafe enquiry to a person who may cause harm; use the restricted safeguarding route where applicable.

An assessment describes a lawyer''s judgment on the information and scope available. Outcomes depend on facts, evidence, other parties and decision-makers. No platform rating, AI output, marketing statement or fee guarantees success. Ask the responsible lawyer to clarify deadlines, immediate protective options, limitations and any further engagement needed. Lex does not calculate legal deadlines or file documents on your behalf.
',0,'caMvUx6ef1HcCmtzTh3Dk8aNyHK7lWvhroVsithdJXg=','[]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='emergency-outcomes';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-intercompany-services','intercompany-services','Intercompany Technology and Publishing Agreement — Review Draft','owner',0,'owners','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'intercompany-services-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Intercompany Technology and Publishing Agreement — Review Draft

## Parties and purpose
Golden Epic Limited, Nigerian RC 1538879, and GoldenEpic Solutions Inc., Canadian corporation 1641963-1, propose the following allocation for Lex. This is a private draft, not an executed agreement or a public policy. Each signatory must establish authority for the company represented. A co-founder legal review is not automatically execution on behalf of both companies.

Golden Epic Limited operates the Nigerian marketplace, contracts with Nigerian platform customers, coordinates professional onboarding, handles platform complaints and proposes the Nigerian merchant relationship. Independent lawyers provide legal services under their engagements. GoldenEpic Solutions Inc. supplies software development, maintenance, hosting administration and store publishing where permitted by the store and documented rights.

## Rights and services
Identify existing software, brand and content ownership in [IP_RIGHTS_SCHEDULE]. Grant only the hosting, distribution, modification and support licences actually needed. No present IP assignment is created by this draft. Specify service support, change management, security responsibilities, incident cooperation, subcontractor approval and exit assistance in [SERVICE_SCHEDULE]. Each company remains separately responsible for its contracts, taxes and statutory duties.

## Data and confidentiality
Record controller/processor roles by activity in [DATA_PROCESSING_SCHEDULE], including instructions, confidentiality, authorized access, international transfers, subprocessors, security controls, incident notice, rights-request assistance, deletion/return and audit evidence. The Canadian company may not repurpose Nigerian matter information for unrelated products. Any independent-controller activity requires its own lawful basis and notice.

## Commercial and governance terms
Complete [INTERCOMPANY_FEES_AND_TAX_SCHEDULE] following appropriate Nigerian and Canadian tax advice, including currency, invoicing, expenses and any transfer-pricing obligations. This agreement does not authorize sharing legal fees unlawfully or holding client money. Record authorized representatives, term, termination notice, handover obligations, governing law and dispute process in [EXECUTION_SCHEDULE].

## Approval and execution
Both companies must approve their obligations through duly authorized representatives. Review of the draft, electronic consent, signing intent, exact version, timestamp and evidence must be retained. Changes after review require a new version. Do not describe this document as signed, legally effective or an ownership transfer until the required parties have executed the completed agreement.
',1,'ZQoV5yijPfdSi4tO1D05R9xW21bsOdoPT2sWOsQm4pc=','["IP_RIGHTS_SCHEDULE","SERVICE_SCHEDULE","DATA_PROCESSING_SCHEDULE","INTERCOMPANY_FEES_AND_TAX_SCHEDULE","EXECUTION_SCHEDULE"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='intercompany-services';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-lawyer-participation','lawyer-participation','Lawyer Participation Terms','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'lawyer-participation-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Lawyer Participation Terms

These terms govern participation in Lex''s marketplace operated by Golden Epic Limited. A role assignment or application receipt does not authorize practice or marketplace visibility. Applicants must provide accurate identity, call and Supreme Court/NBA details, current practising evidence, capabilities, jurisdiction, contact, availability and payout information. Notify Lex promptly of expiry, suspension, disciplinary restrictions or changes affecting eligibility.

Accept only work within your competence and lawful authority. Conduct and record conflicts clearance before accepting a paid service; disclose only the minimum reason needed when declining. Protect client confidentiality, control staff access, keep MFA enabled and use evidence only for the authorized engagement. Never represent that AI-generated material has been reviewed when it has not.

State scope, exclusions, fees and responsibilities before engagement. Meet accepted service deadlines or promptly explain delay and propose a lawful remedy. Requests for missing information and any SLA pause must be specific, visible and audited. Written assessments require your personal review and attestation. You remain responsible for professional judgment, advice and any legal deadlines you enter.

Payments follow the approved service and provider arrangements. A test allocation is not an agreed production commission. Production remuneration, deductions, refunds and expenses require a reviewed commercial schedule consistent with professional obligations. Lex does not provide escrow. Do not request off-record payments to evade agreed terms or confuse the client about who receives funds.

Lex may suspend the affected listing or assignment for expired credentials, documented misconduct or material security concerns, with review and a client continuity process. Suspension does not erase records or outstanding duties. On withdrawal, cooperate in lawful handover and refund resolution. Contact [COMPLAINTS_CONTACT] for a decision review. Statutory and professional duties prevail over any inconsistent platform term.
',1,'FF/M4waGFdpAimIEjd9scP3jAvvoFQJ0UeThqnCFmSU=','["COMPLAINTS_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='lawyer-participation';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-marketplace-disclosure','marketplace-disclosure','Marketplace and Legal Services Disclosure','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'marketplace-disclosure-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Marketplace and Legal Services Disclosure

Golden Epic Limited operates Lex as a technology and service-coordination platform. Independent verified lawyers or identified law firms provide legal advice. Professional verification checks eligibility at a recorded time; it is not a guarantee of an outcome or a substitute for the lawyer''s continuing duties.

Matching uses practice area, jurisdiction, language, current verification, availability, workload and relevant urgency capability. Lawyers cannot purchase ranking. Clients choose from eligible results where coverage exists. Where no eligible lawyer is available, operations-assisted matching occurs before payment. Urgent and safeguarding requests require restricted human review. Lex is not an emergency response service.

The chosen lawyer must clear conflicts before payment for the initial service. Provide accurate party information, but avoid detailed confidential disclosures beyond what the intake requests before conflict clearance. You may decline a suggested match, correct classification or ask for human review. A matching result or AI summary does not itself establish representation.

Before commitment, the service record identifies the lawyer, scope, price, service timing and applicable terms. Advice is delivered only through lawyer attestation. Additional representation, negotiations, filings or court work require a separate engagement; they are not included simply because the same matter remains visible in Lex.

Complain about platform conduct through [COMPLAINTS_CONTACT]. Concerns about a lawyer''s professional conduct may also be raised through the applicable professional process. These channels do not restrict legal rights or lawful reporting.
',1,'69qa7HaaqAx26vtfP3Zu6UsEkU4KNJucMAQRQb55qYs=','["COMPLAINTS_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='marketplace-disclosure';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-mobile-eula','mobile-eula','Mobile End User Licence Agreement','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'mobile-eula-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Mobile End User Licence Agreement

Golden Epic Limited grants you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable licence to use the Lex mobile application on devices you control for lawful access to the platform. Technology and publishing services may be provided by GoldenEpic Solutions Inc. under documented rights. This licence does not transfer ownership of software, brands or third-party components.

Do not use the application to impersonate another person, circumvent access restrictions, distribute malware or unlawfully obtain confidential records. Restrictions on reverse engineering apply only to the extent permitted by law. Open-source components remain governed by their own licences, available in the application''s notices.

Camera, microphone, selected photos and notifications are requested in context. Denying an optional permission leaves other supported input methods available. You are responsible for keeping your device secure. Updates may address security or compatibility; material service changes will be explained. Uninstalling the application does not terminate a lawyer engagement or delete the account; use the account deletion process.

For an Apple-distributed version, this agreement is between you and the identified licensor, not Apple. Apple is not responsible for maintenance or support. To the extent Apple''s minimum EULA terms apply, Apple and its subsidiaries are third-party beneficiaries and may enforce those terms. Applicable store usage rules and mandatory consumer warranties continue to apply. No clause excludes a remedy that cannot lawfully be excluded.

Support and legal notices: [SUPPORT_CONTACT]. Termination of this licence for material breach must be proportionate and does not cancel accrued rights, required records or a valid refund claim.
',1,'Evl4fKx0IpivvD9k3LMYA9XGZ44et9CXTG6X8U6+pE8=','["SUPPORT_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='mobile-eula';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-payments-refunds','payments-refunds','Payments, Cancellations, Refunds and Settlement','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'payments-refunds-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Payments, Cancellations, Refunds and Settlement

Golden Epic Limited is the proposed Nigerian platform merchant. The checkout must identify the merchant, professional service provider, currency, total price, included taxes or expenses and any client-borne fee before confirmation. The responsible lawyer clears conflicts before the initial payment is requested. Representation invoices require their own approved scope and payment.

Payment is successful only after server-side provider verification. A redirect, screenshot or pending debit alone is not confirmation. If money appears debited but the matter remains unpaid, retain the reference and request reconciliation instead of repeatedly paying. Confirmed duplicate collections must be investigated and the duplicate amount returned where due.

You may request cancellation before delivery. Where no service has been provided, or the assigned lawyer cannot deliver, request reassignment or a full refund of the affected purchased service. For partially completed representation or assessment work, any proposed deduction must identify the agreed, actually performed work and lawful basis; it is not an automatic blanket non-refundable fee. Mandatory consumer rights take priority. A reassignment does not authorize a second charge for the same undelivered service.

Refund requests are reviewed with the payment and work record. Approved refunds are initiated through the original provider where possible and tracked to completion; provider and bank processing times vary. We will communicate status rather than guarantee a banking settlement date. Chargebacks may proceed through your bank; cooperate with evidence requests and avoid double recovery. A dispute does not authorize retaliation or destruction of records.

Direct provider allocation is not escrow. The displayed 20/80 test allocation is not a binding production arrangement. Production fees and settlements require [APPROVED_COMMERCIAL_SCHEDULE] and provider approval. Support: [SUPPORT_CONTACT]; dispute escalation: [COMPLAINTS_CONTACT].
',1,'4GkFOQipKeYX/sR/n4oUYU/bMhdWpbAU12tsFdhtvY8=','["APPROVED_COMMERCIAL_SCHEDULE","SUPPORT_CONTACT","COMPLAINTS_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='payments-refunds';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-platform-terms','platform-terms','Platform Terms and Conditions','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'platform-terms-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Platform Terms and Conditions

## Who operates Lex
Lex is a managed legal-access platform operated for Nigerian customers by Golden Epic Limited, RC 1538879, incorporated in Nigeria on 5 November 2018, with registered office at Plot C & D, Embassy Street, Zone 6, Ado-Ekiti, Ekiti State, Nigeria. GoldenEpic Solutions Inc., Canadian corporation 1641963-1, provides technology services under separately documented arrangements. Neither common ownership nor the Lex brand merges the companies'' obligations. Contact: [SUPPORT_CONTACT].

## Your account and use of the platform
Provide accurate contact information, protect verification codes and report suspected misuse. Use only roles and organizational authority assigned to you. An adult may request services for themselves. Organization and minor-related requests follow the authority and safeguarding procedures described in the Protected Accounts terms. Do not submit another person''s information unless needed for a lawful request. You may decline optional AI processing and use available structured intake instead.

## Legal services
Lex organizes intake, matching, communication and administration. Lex is not a law firm, a court or an emergency service. A shortlist does not create a lawyer-client engagement. The responsible lawyer or firm, service scope, fee and engagement terms must be identified before the applicable paid service begins. The lawyer is responsible for professional advice and conflicts. Representation requires a separate accepted proposal. No outcome or uninterrupted availability is promised.

## Payment, suspension and ending use
Review the price, currency, service, fee allocation and cancellation terms before paying. Verified provider confirmation determines payment status. The Payments Policy governs cancellation and remedies without excluding mandatory consumer rights. We may restrict an affected account or operation for fraud, threats, professional suspension or security incidents, giving reasons and a review route where lawful and safe. We will not use suspension to avoid earned refund obligations.

## Responsibility and changes
Each party remains responsible for its own acts and applicable statutory duties. These terms do not exclude liability that cannot lawfully be excluded. Nigerian law applies to the Nigerian platform contract, subject to mandatory rights and the separately agreed lawyer engagement. Complaints may be raised through [COMPLAINTS_CONTACT]; lawful court and regulator access is preserved. Material changes are versioned and notified before taking effect; new terms do not silently rewrite an existing engagement.
',1,'gwFEV6nrCgbHf7cKO8GuN3vB3XkKrs6EOjMSgXGFdr8=','["SUPPORT_CONTACT","COMPLAINTS_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='platform-terms';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-privacy-notice','privacy-notice','Privacy Notice','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'privacy-notice-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Privacy Notice

## Responsibility and contact
Golden Epic Limited is the proposed controller for the Nigerian platform activities described here. Its registered office is Plot C & D, Embassy Street, Zone 6, Ado-Ekiti, Ekiti State, Nigeria. Contact the privacy team at [PRIVACY_CONTACT]. GoldenEpic Solutions Inc. provides technology services; its processor or independent-controller responsibilities must match the executed arrangements. An independently engaged lawyer may have separate professional recordkeeping and controller duties, which their engagement notice must explain.

## Information and purposes
We process contact and verification information, account roles, authority evidence, professional credentials, matter facts, parties, documents, voice recordings, transcripts, messages, payment references, consent records and security logs. Payment providers handle payment credentials; do not put card secrets or verification codes into a matter. We use information to deliver requested services, check authority and professional eligibility, arrange matching, communicate, prevent abuse and meet applicable duties.

The legal basis depends on the purpose: steps requested before or under a contract, applicable legal obligations, documented legitimate interests with appropriate safeguards, or specific consent where required. Acknowledging this notice is not blanket consent. Sensitive and children''s information requires the applicable additional conditions and safeguards. Only collect identity evidence that is necessary for the relevant verification.

## Sharing and AI
Assigned staff and the selected lawyer receive access appropriate to their tasks. Service providers process relevant data under documented terms; see the Subprocessors Notice. AI processing requires a separate disclosure and applicable permission. Inputs are minimized; organized facts must be checked by the client. Legal professional privilege is not guaranteed merely by sending information to Lex or an AI service. Cross-border transfers require a documented lawful basis and protections, not merely a choice of EU storage.

## Your choices and rights
You can request access, correction, export, deletion, restriction, consent withdrawal and human review of routing, subject to applicable law and necessary identity checks. Use the account privacy controls or [PRIVACY_CONTACT]. You may complain to the Nigeria Data Protection Commission. Withdrawal does not undo prior lawful processing; we explain any service impact and records retained for a documented obligation or legal claim. Retention periods are set out in the reviewed retention schedule. We do not sell matter information or permit its use for advertising profiles.
',1,'WskKa5DdfkOSYFhxOkFQ3NKyQEgslTjp5OJPbHhBEpw=','["PRIVACY_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='privacy-notice';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-protected-accounts','protected-accounts','Minors, Guardians, Safeguarding and Organizations','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'protected-accounts-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Minors, Guardians, Safeguarding and Organizations

A person under 18 may begin with a minimal account. Detailed legal facts, documents, lawyer sharing and payment require the relevant verified guardian authority and lawful processing conditions. Guardian verification uses proportionate identity and relationship evidence and recorded consent; possessing a phone or payment card alone does not prove guardianship.

If a guardian may be implicated in abuse, a conflict or an unsafe disclosure, use the safeguarding route. Restricted staff assess a lawful protective response; ordinary guardian access must not automatically expose the enquiry. Exceptions based on vital interests, court authority or other legal grounds require recorded human decisions. Lex does not promise emergency protection or immediate response. Seek appropriate local emergency assistance for immediate danger.

An organization representative must identify the entity, their role and their authority to instruct. Operations verifies the appropriate registration and authority evidence before sharing, matching or payment. An employee is not automatically authorized to bind an organization. Membership removal must address future access without erasing valid records or changing the identity of the client.

The responsible lawyer separately determines whom they represent and whether conflicts or professional restrictions prevent acting. The platform''s account approval is not a court determination of guardianship, capacity or authority. False authority, unsafe access and mistaken information can be reported through [SAFEGUARDING_CONTACT] or the restricted in-app review route. Only necessary reviewers should see identity and safeguarding evidence.
',1,'UswW5FWKrH7HFflcLjumWRtFQIQloQjVzgUmdLitQDA=','["SAFEGUARDING_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='protected-accounts';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-representation-engagement','representation-engagement','Representation Engagement Terms','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'representation-engagement-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Representation Engagement Terms

An initial consultation does not authorize ongoing representation. Representation begins only through a separate proposal identifying the client, responsible lawyer or firm, scope, excluded work, fee basis, expenses, milestones, client responsibilities and cancellation provisions, followed by acceptance and required conflicts confirmation. Lex is not a party providing professional representation merely because it hosts the workflow.

The lawyer must confirm applicable deadlines and explain the agreed reporting process. Platform reminders assist coordination; they do not calculate a legal deadline, extend time or prove that a filing occurred. The client should promptly communicate notices and developments. Only an expressly authorized practitioner may carry out regulated professional acts.

Each invoice identifies the engagement and work or milestone charged, with a preserved allocation and fee snapshot. Approval of a proposal does not authorize unlimited expenses, automatic card charges or unagreed additional work. A material scope or fee change requires a documented variation accepted by the affected parties.

Either party may seek termination subject to professional duties, applicable law and the agreed terms. Record work completed, unearned sums, outstanding expenses, file access, handover and any deadline risk. Do not delete evidence or communications to resolve a dispute. The lawyer remains responsible for lawful withdrawal and client protection. Refunds, disputed amounts and chargebacks follow the applicable invoice and Payments Policy without preventing professional or court remedies.

The final proposal must include [RESPONSIBLE_LAWYER_OR_FIRM], verified professional details, agreed scope and the specific commercial schedule. This master document does not fill those engagement-specific fields or itself retain a lawyer.
',1,'5sRAhiU1OWDqyzHAfW2MmrByMKyM7VM9D19FtFrW5NA=','["RESPONSIBLE_LAWYER_OR_FIRM"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='representation-engagement';

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO legal_documents (id,code,title,audience,optional,visibility,acceptance_kind,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('legal-cross-border-subprocessors','cross-border-subprocessors','Cross-Border Processing and Service Providers','all',0,'public','notice','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z');

INSERT INTO legal_document_versions (id,document_id,version,language,status,content_markdown,company_placeholder_present,content_hash,unresolved_fields_json,created_at,updated_at) SELECT 'cross-border-subprocessors-en-v2',id,2,'en','draft','# Cross-Border Processing and Service Providers

Golden Epic Limited uses technology and service providers for defined operational purposes. GoldenEpic Solutions Inc. is the proposed technology provider, subject to executed terms. Providers may act as processors or independent controllers for particular activities; their role must be recorded rather than assumed from a vendor name.

The current integration inventory includes Cloudflare for staging compute, data and private objects; Meta for WhatsApp delivery; OpenAI for consented AI and transcription; Paystack and Flutterwave for payments; Postmark for email; and Expo with underlying Apple/Google services for push. An implemented integration is not necessarily active. [APPROVED_PROCESSOR_REGISTER] must identify the active legal entities, purpose, data categories, countries, terms, retention and transfer safeguards for the public deployment.

Docker describes how software runs, not where data stays. Hosting on a Canadian computer, a later server, EU storage or globally distributed compute has different processing implications. EU-restricted storage does not establish that every provider or computation remains in the EU. Before relevant transfers, document the applicable lawful basis and protection assessment and provide required information to users.

Share only the data needed for the stated task. Do not send authentication secrets or unrelated matter records to AI or messaging providers. Material provider or purpose changes require review and an updated notice; obtain additional permission where required. Questions and objections can be raised at [PRIVACY_CONTACT].
',1,'eDgzS0BN5HPisdGXodtht+K7JTZ1nf3n+u7cttio7P4=','["APPROVED_PROCESSOR_REGISTER","PRIVACY_CONTACT"]','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z' FROM legal_documents WHERE code='cross-border-subprocessors';

UPDATE legal_documents SET acceptance_kind='notice' WHERE code IN ('emergency-outcomes','cross-border-subprocessors');
